    LLM: "Collect high cards of a single suit. Don't hold onto low cards even if they are Aces in a different suit.\n\nWatch the widow cards that opponents take; track which suits are being 'drained' from the shared pool.\n\nTactical knocking: If you have 25+ points early, knocking might catch opponents before they can assemble a viable hand.",
